# Where fw_printenv/fw_setenv find the U-Boot environment: <device> <offset> <size>.
# U-Boot writes it at the raw offset CONFIG_ENV_OFFSET (0x3F8000) on the card; this
# reaches the same 32 KiB as offset 0 of the uboot_env partition. The wks,
# rauc-env.cfg and this file must agree -- scripts/check-wks-layout.py checks.
# Installed by oe-core's u-boot.inc into u-boot-rockchip-env. docs/agents/rauc.md.
/dev/disk/by-partlabel/uboot_env 0x0000 0x8000
